{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Game Resistance.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Game Resistance.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"game resistance game resistance","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Game Resistance.md","fileName":"Game Resistance.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Game Resistance","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 15:28\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Game Challenge Design]] [[Play Design Elements]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Challenge Design","Play Design Elements","Game Verb","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Game Resistance.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Game Resistance.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"game resistance game resistance","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Game Resistance.md","fileName":"Game Resistance.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Game Resistance","heading":"Game Resistance","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Game resistance is the push and pull between a player's actions and the system's response. The player pushes through [[Game Verb|verbs]] and choices; the game pushes back through rules, obstacles, consequences, and limits, or pulls forward through goals and rewards.\n\nResistance includes more than difficulty. It also includes how widely the game opens its choices, how firmly rules refuse an action, how the experience changes over time, and whether the player can influence the pace or purpose of play.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Challenge Design","Play Design Elements","Game Verb","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Game Resistance.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Game Resistance.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"game resistance game resistance","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Game Resistance.md","fileName":"Game Resistance.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Game Resistance","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[agamedesignvocabulary.pdf]]\n[[gamesdesignandplay.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Challenge Design","Play Design Elements","Game Verb","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}